{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine","doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"convenience","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"transitions","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/TransitionRule","text":"TransitionRule","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine14TransitionRuleV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C5Eventxmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachineEvent\/EventTrigger-swift.associatedtype","text":"EventTrigger","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC5EventP0D7TriggerQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">>, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialState","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C0B0q_mfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"logCapacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MiamiStateMachine\/documentation\/MiamiStateMachine\/StateMachine\/DefinitionError","text":"DefinitionError","preciseIdentifier":"s:17MiamiStateMachine0bC0C15DefinitionErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"plat